RE:
REVISED Proposal for Construction Administration Services for
GYMNASTICS FACILITY SITE DEVELOPMENT, ENGINEERING AND ARCHITECTURAL PLANS
PROJECT (RFP #7-23), PROJECT S-6-24

Jason and TJ:

We are excited to see the City of Cheyenne Gymnastics Facility Project proceed into construction. As we have
discussed, the Construction Administration (CA) Phase of the project is a critical phase of the project. During the
CA phase the design team (Architect, Civil Engineer, Structural Engineer, Mechanical Engineer, and Electrical
Engineer) will be the City’s advocate and act as owner’s representative to ensure quality of the project is
constructed as specified and designed.  If, as you review our proposal, you have any questions, please do not
hesitate to contact me.

Thank you again,

Randy Byers, AIA, LEED APBD+C

randy@tdsi.us
