PROFESSIONAL SERVICES FEES

•
Construction Administration (CA) Phase .................................................. $109,500
•
Post Construction (PC) Phase ........................................................ Included above

PRODUCTS OF SERVICE

 In general, the anticipated Products of Service include the following:

•
Construction Administration Phase:

Representing and acting on behalf of the owner

Newforma ConstructEx Project Cloud Portal

Architect’s Field Reports

Reviewing and acting on the contractor’s submittals

Making site visits to observe the work

Attending Owner, Architect and Contractor (OAC) meetings.

Keeping the owner informed on the progress of the work

Reviewing the contractor’s applications for payment

Responding to requests for information (RFI’s) from the contractor

Interpreting the contract documents upon request

Issuing modifications to the contract documents

Making decisions about technical and code issues

Preparing construction change directives and proposal requests

•
Post Construction (Warranty Period) Phase:

Record Drawings

6th Month Inspection Report

11th Month Inspection Report

23rd Month Inspection Report

The involvement of the Architect and the Architect’s Consultants during the Construction Administration
Phase of the project is an integral part of their professional services and is essential to a cohesive, and
successful project. If the Owner elects to not retain the Architect and Architect’s Consultants for the
Construction Administration or Post Construction phases, a written release and indemnification shall be
executed by the parties.
