INSURANCE

 Professional Liability Insurance:
•
TDSi currently carries a Professional Liability insurance policy provided by CNA through Victor
Insurance Managers Inc. / Continental Casualty Company. The policy is a “claims-made” policy
with a maximum limit of liability of $1,000,000 per claim, with an aggregate limit of $2,000,000 per
year. Our firm has never had a claim against our policy. A Certificate of Insurance will be provided
upon written request.

 General Business Liability Insurance:
•
TDSi carries a General Business Liability policy provided by AMCO Insurance Company and
Allied Insurance Company of America. A Certificate of Insurance that enumerates the various
